the barney / jurassic version).

A Saurian:
- A *huge* vegetarian lizard living in the lower levels (3 characters long?).
- It won't notice other creatures (being so huge) and cannot be killed.
  Teleporting it will take 3 charges, metamorfosing it will make several
  other monsters etc...
- It can kill others by stomping or shitting (you drown...) on them.
- Normally it moves very slowly, but will get wild if it smells you
  wielding a vegetable :-) (it won't smell it from a pack etc.). When
  it's wild it will come from anywhere on level to you (not through
  walls, only doors), stomping all the monsters on the way... If you
  won't throw the vegetable to it, it will munch you up with the
  vegetable (bad if you fell in sleep or freeze).
- You can tame it, but normally it will be *much* slower than anything
  on NetHack. And remember that it will get wild if you abandon it
  (them it won't be satisfied with some smelly vegetable...). 
- When it is wild and crazily stomping around, there's a 1/10000 change
  of dungeon collapsing.
- It leaves in swampy habitat.


